# Search-tool ignore list (ripgrep / Claude Code Glob+Grep). Not a git ignore.
# Worktrees are full repo copies: searching them times out and returns duplicate
# hits that waste agent context. ripgrep reads this file even when VCS ignores
# are bypassed. To search a worktree on purpose, run the search inside it.
.worktrees/
.claude/worktrees/
**/.worktrees/
node_modules/
